 with respect to the internal audit follow up activities update dashboard, BE RECEIVED.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2025-11-19 12:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2025-11-19 Submission - (4.5) Internal Audit Follow-Up Activities Dashboard", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=120841", "date": "2025-11-19 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "6": {"title": "Follow-up to Housing and Homelessness - Value for Money Audit - Councillor S. Stevenson", "number": "6", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Stevenson", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the City of London Internal Auditors (MNP) BE DIRECTED to provide a supplementary report to a future meeting of the Audit Committee (by Q2 2026), which will include:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a) \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 a cost-benefit analysis of operating and administrative expenses;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b) \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 clarification of where additional costs to support Hubs are being allocated; and", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "c) \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 an explanation of how the incremental cost of Hubs is supporting the intended outcomes.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "it being noted that this analysis will rely on data contained in the working papers of the August 28, 2025 Housing and Homelessness Value for Money (VFM) Audit, with an estimated cost of $5\u201310K and no additional funding source being required.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "it being further noted that the Audit Committee received a communication dated November 9, 2025 from Councillor S. Stevenson with respect to this matter.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2025-11-19 12:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2025-11-19 Submission - Housing and Homelessness Value for Money Audit-S. Stevenson", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=120843", "date": "2025-11-19 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}}, "datetime": "2025-11-19 12:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "5": {"title": "Deferred Matters/Additional Business", "number": "5", "content": [{"string": "None.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2025-11-19 12:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "6": {"title": "Confidential\u00a0", "number": "6", "content": [{"string": "None.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2025-11-19 12:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "7": {"title": "Adjournment", "number": "7", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by P. Cuddy", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the meeting BE ADJOURNED.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [{"string": "The meeting adjourned at 12:40 PM.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2025-11-19 12:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}}, "__class__": "Meeting"}